 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Rocky Horror Picture Show" href="/whats-on/the-rocky-horror-picture-show" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Rocky Horror Picture Show</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>What better way to see this camp horror classic than on Halloween night and upon the UK’s largest screen.</p>
