 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Spirit of St. Louis" href="/whats-on/the-spirit-of-st-louis" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Spirit of St. Louis</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Billy Wilder’s take on the biopic offers an optimistic insight into famed aviator Charles Lindbergh, portrayed with all the charm and depth we expect from Jimmy Stewart.</p>
