 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Watermelon Woman" href="/whats-on/the-watermelon-woman" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Watermelon Woman</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Thirty years since its release, Cheryl Dunye’s influential first feature is as bold and hilarious today as it was in 1996.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="workData" role="group" aria-label="Show information" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
