  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Wild Angels" href="/whats-on/the-wild-angels" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Wild Angels</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Roger Corman’s brutal tale, starring Peter Fonda, Nancy Sinatra and Bruce Dern, sees a wild biker gang rampaging, following the death of one of their own.</p>
