   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Tim Burton’s Corpse Bride" href="/whats-on/tim-burtons-corpse-bride" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Tim Burton’s Corpse Bride</a></h3>
