  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Tristes Tropiques " href="/whats-on/tristes-tropiques" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Tristes Tropiques <span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf> - London Korean Film Festival Closing Night</span></a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>In the wake of a kingpin’s death, the assassins he has trained, and criminal rivals, go into a feeding frenzy for power and revenge.</p>
