 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Valerie and Her Week of Wonders" href="/whats-on/valerie-and-her-week-of-wonders" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Valerie and Her Week of Wonders<span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf> - UK Premiere of Restoration</span></a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The boundary between dream and reality blurs in this hallucinatory coming-of-age work with nightmarish turns.</p>
