   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="When Film Studies Was Young" href="/whats-on/when-film-studies-was-young" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>When Film Studies Was Young<span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf> - UEA Film50</span></a></h3>
