 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Wild Horse Nine" href="/whats-on/wild-horse-nine" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Wild Horse Nine<span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf> - Preview</span></a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="status" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Sold out</p>
   </div>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>In Martin McDonagh’s uproarious comedy thriller, John Malkovich and Sam Rockwell play two CIA agents in the turbulent 1970s who are sent to Easter Island to await the overthrow of Chile’s leftist government.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="workData" role="group" aria-label="Show information" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <time itemprop="duration" datetime="PT1H58M" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>1h 58m</time><span aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>|</span><span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>2026</span>
  </div>
 </div>
