  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="X: The Man with X-Ray Eyes" href="/whats-on/x-the-man-with-x-ray-eyes" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>X: The Man with X-Ray Eyes</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Ray Milland is outstanding as a scientist whose X-Ray vision causes him to see terrifying things in Roger Corman’s classic sci-fi.</p>
